        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Steven Johnson, Mohammad Bakri, Adam Bakri, John Travolta, Robert De Niro, Evan Daugherty, Saleh Bakri, Ziad Bakri\n- Works: Killing Season\n- Companies: Millennium Films\n- Roles: screenwriter, film director, producer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Mohammad Bakri was born in 1953 and is an Arab-Israeli actor and film director.\n- Mark Steven Johnson was born on October 30, 1964 and is an American screenwriter, film director, and producer.\n- Killing Season, previously titled Shrapnel, is a 2013 American action thriller film written by Evan Daugherty and directed by Mark Steven Johnson for Millennium Films.\n- Killing Season was the first on-screen pairing of actors John Travolta and Robert De Niro.\n- Adam Bakri comes from a cinematic family and is the son of Mohammad Bakri and the brother of Saleh Bakri and Ziad Bakri.",
